sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Regional edge
    participant Ca as Cache
    participant S as Local store
    participant R2 as Other regions
    C->>E: GET /v1/kv/:key
    E->>Ca: lookup
    alt hit
        Ca-->>E: value + version (a few ms)
    else soft-expired
        Ca-->>E: serve stale, refresh in the background
    else miss
        E->>S: single-flight — one fetch, the rest wait
        S-->>E: value + version
        E->>Ca: populate with a jittered TTL
    end
    E-->>C: value
    C->>E: PUT /v1/kv/:key
    E->>S: write with a new version, invalidate the local cache
    E-->>C: ack locally — never wait for a cross-region round trip
    S->>R2: replicate async, ordered per key, last-writer-wins
    R2->>R2: apply and invalidate the destination cache
